OL,3,GNEWSASubterranean power store planned
OL,4,Ain salt caverns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been drawn up to create a
OL,7,Frenewable power battery in underground
OL,8,Fsalt caverns.
OL,10,FEnergy firm Storelectric has acquired
OL,11,Fhundreds of acres of land at Seal
OL,12,FSands, near Billingham, on Teesside and
OL,13,Fwants to take electricity from green
OL,14,Fsources and store it as compressed air.
OL,16,FThe project - Teesside Compressed Air
OL,17,FEnergy Storage (TeesCAES) - which aims
OL,18,Fto increase the output from sources of
OL,19,Frenewable power, has won provisional
OL,20,Fapproval from the energy regulator
OL,21,FOfgem.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
