OL,3,GNEWSASubterranean power store planned
OL,4,Ain salt caverns
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorelectric's executive director
OL,7,FTallat Azad said the scheme would stop
OL,8,Fpotential energy going to waste and aid
OL,9,Fthe "green transition to net zero
OL,10,Femissions".
